   1253          /**
   1254           *    @brief    This method handles Uart Data Transmission and also the break signal
   1255           *    @details  The break signal has highest priority then the Data Transmission.\n
   1256           *              If the application requests for the Break signal transmission then handler inserts break signal after
   1257           *              completion of the ongoing transmission\n
   1258           *              and stops the further Data transmission until the Break signal is resumed.\n
   1259           *              This method checks if there is data in transmit FIFO. If data is present then this method\n
   1260           *              transmits the data on Uart.
